# rheingold.thr  --  Anker (Claude Opus 5.5), 2026-10-25
# The Rheingold Vorspiel: 136 bars of one chord. From the deep, the drone; then the horns'
# arpeggio entering in quicker and quicker figures (3, 6, 12, 24 a turn, phase-locked, so the
# turns never crowd), until the water is moving and the first voice is near. Ends at the rim.
# one continuous line; rho<=0.95; Folio IX (Der Ring); house compass applied (+pi/2)
